WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.474
Thila ani bateba. O ye kibaro diiman dɔ lo ye.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.274
Ayiwa, o ye Kambirɛ dugumɔgɔw ta so ye; bon barakaman dɔ lo.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.834
A be komi fɛɛn si tɛ se k'a sɔrɔ. O bɛɛ n'a ta.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.682
Loon dɔ, Kambiré ka deen banana. A tun tɛ se k'o muɲu.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.770
O kɔ, sa dɔ tagara don bon kɔnɔ. Tɔɔrɔ tun donna an ka soo kɔnɔ.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.904
Kambiré tagara muso dɔ fɛ min be se ka koo nataw lɔn.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:15.400
N' deen be tɔɔrɔla. Jɔn lo b'an darabɔ?

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:16.604
An k'a filɛ.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:24.034
O kɔ, a y'a ka jirisunw fili duguma. A ye wagatijan kɛ k'u filɛ.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.994
O ye "tilas" lo ye. U b'a fɛ i ka koo dɔ kɛ.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.864
O suu yɛrɛ la, Kambiré ye siko dɔ kɛ.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.008
O kɔ, o ka yiri bisigiya dɔ yira a ra.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:03.284
I k'a dilan. A to i ka soo. A bena to k'a yɛrɛ kɔrɔsi.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:11.248
Tuma min na Kambiré kununna, a tun b'a lɔn a ka ɲi ka min kɛ.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.664
A ye lɔgɔ dɔ ta k'a tigɛtigɛ, a ma foyi fɔ.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.192
O kɔ, u ye tugu ɲɔgɔn kɔ.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.792
O ye batebaw lo ye.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:10.768
A ka o fɛnw bla sarakajɛnifɛn kan, Alabatosoba donda ra, ani siman saraka.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.344
U ka somɔgɔw y'u fo, i n'a fɔ u b'a kɛ cogo min na.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.432
O dugusagwɛ, sa segira ka na.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:52.386
A gbarara sarakajɛnifɛn na minkɛ, o bɛɛ kununna. O kɔ, u ye yeelenba dɔ ye.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.144
Sogojugu nin segira ka taga.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:24.202
Sɔgɔmada joona fɛ, den tun be tulon kɛ lu kɔnɔ. Kabi o wagati la, lobiw b'a fɔ ko bateba dɔw be soo kɔrɔsi.
